{"data": {"Page": {"pageInfo": {"currentPage": 2, "hasNextPage": true}, "media": [{"id": 11097, "title": {"romaji": "Zou no Inai Doubutsuen", "english": null}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "From a children's book written by Ren Saito for his daughter based off of true events, which tells the story of two children being told of what happened to the animals of Ueno Zoo during World War II and later witnessing the arrival of Indira an elephant that was a gift from the prime mister of India in 1949.", "startDate": {"year": 1982, "month": 3}, "endDate": {"year": 1982, "month": 3}, "season": "SPRING", "seasonYear": 1982, "episodes": 1, "duration": 79, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "OTHER", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Drama"], "tags": []}, {"id": 11829, "title": {"romaji": "Manga Mitokoumon", "english": null}, "format": "TV", "description": "Mitokomon is the empror's trusted man with a high sense of justice. He is sent to travel around the country in order to observe the quality of life in each province and run a check on the official's performances and report back to the empror. Along with him are sent two bodyguards, Kaiko (known for his extraordinary power) and Tsuke (known for his amazing swordsmanship). The three men, traveling unknown, face lots of adventure on their journey to bring justice to the citizens and eliminate corruption from the governing system.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Anime News Network)", "startDate": {"year": 1981, "month": 9}, "endDate": {"year": 1982, "month": 7}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 1981, "episodes": 46, "duration": 24, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": null, "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": [{"name": "Historical", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 12243, "title": {"romaji": "Game Center Arashi", "english": null}, "format": "TV", "description": "Arashi Ishino is Japan's \"Space invaders\" champion. He must use his skills to beat others at different video games.", "startDate": {"year": 1982, "month": 5}, "endDate": {"